    "title": "Sun Devil Baseball weekly preview: Feb. 17 - Mar. 1 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 days ago PHOENIX - Sun Devil Baseball will look to gain momentum after sweeping Omaha in their season-opening series as they’ll take on UConn and St. John’s this week. On Friday, Cole Carlon opened the season on a high note. He tossed five innings and only allowed one run, while the bullpen put on a strong effort for the remainder of the game, including Derek Schaefer tossing a 1-2-3 inning in the ninth. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
